  m_Text: 'A more complex example using Metadata to hold junction state and several
    SplineControllers to keep Axes and Waggons on the track. Also showing a way to
    address float inaccuracy and keep relative distances between all elements constant.

    Click on the floating checkbox before the train reaches it to activate/deactivate
    the junction.'
